<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Islam Malaysia boosts Takaful stake.</title>
<headline>Bank Islam Malaysia boosts Takaful stake.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Islam Malaysia Bhd said on Thursday that it has acquired an additional 2.5 million shares of Syarikat Takaful Malaysia Bhd, increasing its stake in the insurer to 70.12 percent.</p>
<p>The acquisition of shares increases Bank Islam's ownership of Takaful shares to 38.56 million from 36.06 million shares, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
